{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/nix' data-target='computer\/os\/nix' data-title='*Nix'>\r\n\t\t\t*Nix\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Recursive find by name, depth, type, -exec, and files modified within a time window.","label":"find","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/delete","label":"Delete","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/delete"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/ftp","label":"FTP","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/ftp"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>find<\/code> walks a tree recursively.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Name and depth<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>find &lt;path&gt; -name \"&lt;pattern&gt;\"<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tThe search is recursive.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>-maxdepth &lt;n&gt;<\/code> and <code class='inline'>-mindepth &lt;n&gt;<\/code> limit how deep it goes.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Empty directories<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPrint names of empty directories:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>find &lt;path&gt; -type d -empty -printf \"%f\\n\"<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Exec<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRun a command on each match. <code class='inline'>{}<\/code> is the path; <code class='inline'>\\;<\/code> ends <code class='inline'>-exec<\/code>.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>find &lt;path&gt; -type d -maxdepth 1 -exec &lt;command&gt; {} \\;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tExample <code class='inline'>-exec<\/code>:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>-exec ln -s &lt;path&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>find<\/code> includes the starting path, e.g. <code class='inline'>.\/<\/code>. Use <code class='inline'>basename<\/code> to get the file name. <code class='inline'>basename<\/code> cannot be mixed with other commands; it should be the only command of <code class='inline'>-exec<\/code>.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>-type -f<\/code> excludes the starting-directory include (self).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Modified within last period<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>find \/to\/target\/directory* -mmin 30<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tForm:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;path&gt; &lt;time-option&gt; &lt;[+\/-]&lt;units&gt;&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tTime options:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>mtime<\/code> \u2014 modified, in days<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>-cmin<\/code> \u2014 accessed, in minutes<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>-newermt<\/code> \u2014 newer created<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/find\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/find\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/delete' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/delete' data-title='Delete' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Delete<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/ftp' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/ftp' data-title='FTP' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>FTP<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/nix' data-target='computer\/os\/nix' data-title='*Nix'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/computer\/os\/nix.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>*Nix<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}